# Monitor → PipeWire sink mapping for hypr-primary-switch and kde-primary-switch
# Format: OUTPUT_NAME_SINK=alsa_output.xxx (use pactl list sinks short to find names)
# Configured via hyprzzite-settings → Displays → Monitor→Audio Mapping
# Example:
# DP_1_SINK=alsa_output.pci-0000_XX_XX.hdmi-stereo
# DP_2_SINK=alsa_output.pci-0000_XX_XX.analog-stereo
# DP_4_SINK=alsa_output.pci-0000_XX_XX.analog-stereo
